WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:15.639
The world's gonna die. I can feel it coming and I think about Ruth

00:00:20.539 --> 00:00:24.129
How did she survive out there on her own as broken as she is

00:00:42.059 --> 00:00:44.149
Lila, this is your mother

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:51.097
Does she have...

00:00:51.097 --> 00:00:53.780
yes, but not like yours

00:01:02.359 --> 00:01:06.798
Our abilities can't fix things if something's broken it stays broken

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:11.580
Lila's different

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:14.419
She can see the colors. What do they look like?

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:18.659
I've never seen them. It's like an echo

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:22.969
Moving over everything fast like a race

00:01:28.909 --> 00:01:31.329
It's gotten harder for us to stay in hiding

00:01:35.290 --> 00:01:37.290
They know

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:43.140
There's not much time. You cannot be putting her in danger again and not leaving

00:01:44.560 --> 00:01:47.250
This woman can affect the energy of the earth

00:01:52.039 --> 00:01:54.309
We can help you, there are tests we can run

00:02:01.270 --> 00:02:04.089
A new world is coming. I'm not scared anymore

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:13.790
 

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:29.380
 

